# Local env files.
# NOTE: `.env` is intentionally NOT ignored — it is committed on purpose as
# the deploy env source for Lovable (public Supabase keys only, no secrets).
# Keeping it in .gitignore while tracked made deploy tooling skip loading it,
# which blanked VITE_SUPABASE_* in the production bundle. Only truly-local
# override files stay ignored below.
.env.local
.env.*.local
